{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受描写明显不如 Y 细腻，尤其缺少随音乐推进逐层变化的情绪和身体感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 把完整叙事放在左侧，感受放在右侧，观众可以先抓住人物每段在想什么，再用短词补充情绪，不容易在有限时间里迷失阅读顺序。Y 的关键词高亮很有效，音乐同步出现的感受也更细腻、更有层次，但部分段落静态感受词过密，例如 S01、S05，容易让观众来不及消化，也可能抢走叙事的注意力。总体而言，X 更容易让没读过原文的普通观众理解人物心理变化和完整故事，Y 则在音乐表现力和感受精度上更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0fc7ed25-952c-4f4b-9680-238dd1154735", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011201098123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:13:45.859259+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0ad2fc28c045cb2f0548abb3da6f319e4b1422843c81d58ce5394f1bdd7c69e7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\